Package: fl2000-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, libdw1t64
Recommends: fl2000-enumerator (= ${binary:Version}), linux-headers-generic
Description: DRM/KMS driver for Fresco Logic FL2000 adapters (DKMS)
 Builds the FL2000 USB display driver and its adapted IT66121 HDMI bridge
 using DKMS. Both modules are rebuilt automatically for supported kernels.
 .
 This release targets Ubuntu 26.04 amd64 with Linux 7.0. The adapted it66121
 module takes precedence over a same-named distribution module while this
 package is installed. Native OF bridge boards are not a validated target.

Package: fl2000-enumerator
Section: admin
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, fl2000-dkms (= ${binary:Version}), i2c-tools,
 kmod, udev, systemd
Description: automatic HDMI bridge discovery for FL2000 adapters
 Identifies configured bridges on an FL2000 I2C adapter and creates the
 matching I2C client. A udev rule activates a systemd service; supported
 bridge identifiers and parameters are kept in a separate configuration.
